2. Razorpay IFSC dataset
------------------------

Provider:  Razorpay - https://github.com/razorpay/ifsc
Source:    release v2.0.62, file IFSC.csv
           https://github.com/razorpay/ifsc/releases/tag/v2.0.62
           (Razorpay compiles it from lists published by the Reserve Bank of
           India and NPCI.)
Used:      IFSC, branch name and MICR code of selected branches; the bank is
           taken from the IFSC's first four letters.

Verified:
  - The "License" section of the repository's README
    (https://github.com/razorpay/ifsc#license) states: "The code in this
    repository is licensed under the MIT License. License text is available
    in the LICENSE file. The dataset itself is under public domain."
  - The repository's LICENSE file
    (https://github.com/razorpay/ifsc/blob/master/LICENSE) is the MIT
    License, "Copyright (c) 2020 Razorpay". It covers Razorpay's code.
    FormGhost includes none of that code, only values from the dataset.

Credit to Razorpay for compiling and publishing the dataset is given here
voluntarily.
